@startuml
[*] as InitialState
CampaignNotStarted as CampaignNotStarted
CampaignInProgress as CampaignInProgress
CampaignCompleted as CampaignCompleted
CampaignArchived as CampaignArchived

InitialState ->> CampaignNotStarted : Manager and staff assigned
CampaignNotStarted ->> CampaignInProgress : Everything approved and contract signed
CampaignInProgress ->> CampaignInProgress : Adverts prepared, approved, and scheduled
CampaignInProgress ->> CampaignInProgress : Adverts running
CampaignInProgress ->> CampaignCompleted : All adverts finished, payment settled
CampaignInProgress ->> CampaignArchived : Staff and managers released

note right of CampaignInProgress: Extension or adjustment of campaign requested
CampaignInProgress ->> CampaignInProgress : Extension or adjustment of campaign requested

CampaignCompleted ->> CampaignArchived : Payment received (amount paid less than required)
CampaignCompleted ->> CampaignArchived : Correct balance settled (amount paid exceeds required amount)

[*] as FinalState
FinalState ->> CampaignArchived : [*]
@enduml
